{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story takes place on a shattered continent plunged into chaos after the fall of the Creator God. The absence of the divine has caused turmoil and unrest, leaving the world in endless darkness and confusion. You, summoned by mysterious forces, are tasked with vanquishing the factions and restoring the lost light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2026 or is it really that simple?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this unfamiliar world, with lost faith, and unknown encounters, will each soul you meet be an ally or a foe? Will you trust your instincts and beliefs or listen to their words? Have you made the &quot;<strong>RIGHT</strong>&quot; choice? The key to your fate is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u201cThat Time I Got\u00a0Summoned to a New World as a Hero or Becoming a God\u201d</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In this action-packed scroll world, unleash stylish combos with fluid combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slash, sweep, pierce, and spin! In this exciting and flashy battle journey, traverse perilous ruins, wield your weapon with smooth actions and sharp judgment, showcase your combo skills as you defeat enemies, challenge bosses, and end them with a stylish Execution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging enemies + impactful action (with everyone's favorite Rolling) = a satisfying gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u76fe\u5251\u8fde\u51fb.gif?t=1744351307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/Steam\u9875\u9762\u5904\u51b3\u4e09\u8fde.gif?t=1744351307\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In a world of swords and magic, enchant your moves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fire, Ice, Wind, and Lightning magic, each with different effects, add variety to combat, allowing you to create deadly skill combos by weaving them into your moves. Plan your strategy carefully during intense battles to break through crises and turn the tide, or you won\u2019t reach your journey\u2019s end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/\u7b2c\u516d\u5e55-\u96f7\u7535buff\u9ebb\u75f9debuff__1_.gif?t=1744351307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u5b8c\u7f8e\u95ea\u907f.gif?t=1744351307\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A rich variety of enemies ensures your adventure never gets boring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From assassins to minotaurs to giants, each enemy has unique attack patterns and behavior, offering fresh challenges in both Soulslike and fair gameplay.\u00a0Honing your skills, fight for your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/BOSS\u6218\u65971_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1744351307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u98de\u884cboss\u62d4\u5200\u65a92.gif?t=1744351307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/\u683c\u6321\u98de\u884c\u9053\u5177+\u56de\u65cb\u65a9_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1744351307\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 2 playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Various diverse environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rich and stylish moves and combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Satisfying combat with smooth controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 80+ types of enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiple elemental enchantments and summoning spirits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Dynamic combat with strategic depth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A tight, engaging adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>We are a team of freshly graduated university students, and through our passion and research\u00a0for gaming, we present this game, hoping to create a thrilling action game with excellent hit feedback for all players!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3374060?t=1744351307","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/d52209428b3b7fd852a03894fb4dcd4b5ae650c9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744351307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/78728692eed2af3aa7cf16f352bed027ae4238e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744351307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/78728692eed2af3aa7cf16f352bed027ae4238e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744351307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Steam Turn Notifications","id":32},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":6